		<div class="fs-row fs-lg-justify-center">
			<div class="fs-cell fs-lg-10">
				<div class="typography">
					<p>Step up your game at Hilbert College Baseball Camps! Boys ages 7–13 get expert coaching, skills development, and fun competition in hitting, pitching, fielding, and base running. Join us this August for Day Camp or in October for the Prospect ID Camp!</p>

